These files are used in CI builds.

`docker-build-experiments.txt` lists experiment directories that should be tested
via their own Dockerfiles in CI.

`run_ci_docker_command.py` wraps the shared `docker run` arguments used by the
main CI test job and imported by the custom Docker experiment test flow.

`run_ci_tests.py` runs the standard CI experiment + isolated pytest flow.

`run_docker_experiment_tests.py` runs the custom Docker experiment CI flow
(experiment discovery, CI-SHA dependency rewriting, image builds, pytest
execution, and failure log tails).

`pytest_common.py` centralizes shared pytest warning filters and runtime options.
